### ============================================================================
### AUTHENTICATION ENDPOINTS
### ============================================================================
### Gestión de usuarios y autenticación

@api = https://servicioshilda.orioncaribe.com/api/v1

### ============================================================================
### 1. POST /auth/register - Register New User
### ============================================================================
### Registra un nuevo usuario con credenciales tradicionales

POST {{@api}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser123",
  "password": "TestPassword123!",
  "email": "test@example.com"
}

### Response should be 201 Created with JWT token


### ============================================================================
### 2. POST /auth/login - Login with Credentials
### ============================================================================
### Login con username y password

POST {{@api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser123",
  "password": "TestPassword123!"
}

### Response should be 200 OK with accessToken and refreshToken


### ============================================================================
### 3. POST /auth/login-wallet - Login with Solana Wallet Signature
### ============================================================================
### Login usando firma digital de Solana Wallet
### Pasos requeridos:
### 1. Obtener challenge
### 2. Firmar challenge con wallet privada
### 3. Enviar signature

POST {{@api}}/auth/login-wallet
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "publicKey": "4Nd1m1Q5WJGj5CqPKYrZL2g4X2Y8Z3A4B5C6D7E8",
  "message": "login-nonce-123456",
  "signature": "5K1fvW2xY3zZ4aA5bB6cC7dD8eE9fF0gG1hH2iI3jJ4kK5lL6mM7nN8oO9pP0qQ1rR2sS3tT4uU5vV6wW7xX8yY9zZ"
}

### Response should be 200 OK with accessToken


### ============================================================================
### 4. GET /auth/challenge/:publicKey - Get Login Challenge
### ============================================================================
### Obtiene un challenge para firmar antes del login

GET {{@api}}/auth/challenge/4Nd1m1Q5WJGj5CqPKYrZL2g4X2Y8Z3A4B5C6D7E8

### Response should be 200 OK with challenge string and nonce


### ============================================================================
### 5. GET /auth/me - Get Current User Info
### ============================================================================
### Obtiene información del usuario autenticado
### Requiere: JWT accessToken en Authorization header

GET {{@api}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{@accessToken}}

### Response should be 200 OK with user data


### ============================================================================
### 6. POST /auth/logout - Logout
### ============================================================================
### Cierra sesión y invalida el token

POST {{@api}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{@accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{@refreshToken}}"
}

### Response should be 200 OK


### ============================================================================
### 7. POST /auth/refresh - Refresh Token
### ============================================================================
### Genera un nuevo accessToken usando refreshToken

POST {{@api}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{@refreshToken}}"
}

### Response should be 200 OK with new accessToken


### ============================================================================
### 8. POST /auth/verify - Verify Token
### ============================================================================
### Verifica que un token JWT es válido

POST {{@api}}/auth/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "{{@accessToken}}"
}

### Response should be 200 OK if valid, 401 Unauthorized if invalid

